  "details": "About three times during this patch I have come across a seemingly random issue that occurs, most often when the player gets teleported to a new location. This may also happen when they respawn or are loaded into the world for the first time.\n\nThe player capsule will spin uncontrollably and fly around the map, bouncing off of any and all surfaces. The only way to stop this is to respawn the character. A world where this seemed to consistently happen to all players was a couple of stages into the horror world: \"Rest & Sleep Paralysis\". In this world, after being teleported to a brown interior, it would happen every time.\n\nThis also seemed to break the avatar if it was as soon as you loaded in. If using FBT, the foot tracking will be rotated and flown off to the side as if your legs have been displaced far beyond your body. The only way to fix this one was to switch avatars.",
